$string['diagnosticsmode_help'] = 'Stores the full request and response of every AI call this generation makes, so a failure can be read out of the database instead of guessed at.

Off by default, and only offered to users who can configure the plugin. The stored payloads are large: turn it on for a generation you are investigating, not as a habit.

The API key is never stored - only the prompt, the response schema and the response body.

The log entries are NOT deleted with the generation: the record of what the plugin did survives it, deliberately. What does go is the payload - the prompt, the schema and the response are removed automatically after the configured retention period (30 days by default), leaving the technical fields in place. A GDPR deletion request removes it immediately.';
