$string['explanationenabled_help'] = 'Asks the AI to write a short explanation for every answer option, addressed to a student who chose that one - what makes a wrong option wrong, and what makes the right one right. Moodle shows it after the student answers, next to the option they picked.

Off by default, because an explanation is written per option: a six-question generation with four options each is twenty-four extra sentences to generate and pay for.

Only offered for True/False, Single choice and Multiple choice. Ordering keeps one combined feedback for the whole question, and short answer and essay have no options to explain, so there is nowhere to store one.

For True/False this replaces the site-wide feedback template with text about the statement the student just judged.';
